      "content": "I hear the intense pain and desperation in your words, and I want you to know that suicidal thoughts are a cry for help, not a final answer.\nPlease consider reaching out to a suicide prevention lifeline immediately so a real person can listen to you and help you find a way to stay safe.\nYou do not have to make that decision alone, and there is hope for a future where you can feel connected and heard again.\nI hope you will take a moment to find a safe place to call for support right now.",
